<section class="section_primary_content" style="background-color: #f0f0f0;">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="title_sec text-center simple_content_area">
			<h3>Welcome to Urban Homes Thames Coromandel</h3>
<p>We’re proud to call the Coromandel home. Conveniently located on Blacksmith Lane in Whitianga, our friendly, local team is here to help you every step of the way.</p>
<p>Since 2004 Urban Homes has been designing and building quality homes throughout the greater Waikato. From Whangamata to Whitianga, Matarangi, the Thames Coast, and every bay in between, our Coromandel team believe in building beautiful homes and relationships which last for generations.</p>
<p><em>Urban Homes has been operating in the Thames/Coromandel region since 2017 and is owned and operated by Daniel and Tanya Blok of Blok Construction Ltd.<span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody"><br />
</span></em></p>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
<div style="width: 640px;" class="wp-video"><video class="wp-video-shortcode" id="video-11121-1" width="640" height="360" preload="metadata" controls="controls"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/URBAN-COROMANDEL-FIVE_web.mp4?_=1" /><a href="https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/URBAN-COROMANDEL-FIVE_web.mp4">https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/URBAN-COROMANDEL-FIVE_web.mp4</a></video></div>
</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


