									</div>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</div>
											<div class="col-3">
							<div class="team_box">
																	<figure class="bg_set" style="background-image: url('https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Jan-Marett_Square.jpg')"></figure>
									
								<div class="team_content">
									<h4>Jan Marett</h4>		
									<p>Accounts Co-ordinator</p>									<div class="team_contacts">
										<ul>
											<li><a href="mailto:jan.marett@urban.co.nz"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></a></li>										</ul>
									</div>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</div>
											<div class="col-3">
							<div class="team_box">
																	<figure class="bg_set" style="background-image: url('https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Luke-Jarvis_Square.jpg')"></figure>
									
								<div class="team_content">
									<h4>Luke Jarvis</h4>		
									<p>Foreman</p>									<div class="team_contacts">
										<ul>
											<li><a href="mailto:luke.jarvis@urban.co.nz"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></a></li>										</ul>
									</div>
																	</div>
							</div>
						</div>
										</div>
				</div>
												<section class="image_content_sec">
					<div class="container">
						<div class="design_build_category">
							<div class="row">
								<div class="col-6">
																		<figure>
										<img src="https://urban.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/Dan-and-Tanya-Blok.jpg" alt="">
										<figcaption>DAN AND TANYA BLOK - FRANCHISE OWNERS</figcaption>
									</figure>
																	</div>
								<div class="col-6">
																		<div class="design_category_text">
										<h4>Introducing Dan and Tanya, your local franchise owners</h4>
										<p>When we hear people refer to the Coromandel as the &#8220;Bali of New Zealand,&#8221; we can’t help but agree. Whitianga is our home—a haven for those who value beauty, connection, and relaxation.</p>
<p>As the owners of Urban Homes Thames Coromandel, we’re passionate about helping you create a home that’s as exceptional as this stunning region. We’ve been fortunate to combine our love for the Coromandel with years of experience in residential construction across the Waikato and Tauranga.</p>
<p>Living and working in Whitianga has allowed us to immerse ourselves in this community. Whether it’s volunteering with the local fire service, coaching netball, supporting the Mercury Bay Environmental Trust, or partnering with clients to build their dream homes, we’re committed to giving our best to every project and every person we meet.</p>
<p>We believe a home should reflect your lifestyle and the natural beauty of its surroundings. That’s why we work closely with trusted local suppliers and tradespeople to craft homes that meet Urban Homes’ renowned standards for quality, care, and integrity. From bespoke new builds to renovations, we’ll guide you through every step of the journey to ensure its seamless and stress-free.</p>
<p>The Coromandel is more than where we live—it’s a community we love. We’re not just building homes; we’re building lasting relationships and stronger connections within this incredible region.</p>
<p>We’d love the chance to work with you and bring your vision to life. Let’s create a home you’ll be proud to call your own, right here in the Coromandel.</p>
<p>See you soon!</p>
<p><strong>Dan and Tanya – Franchise Owners</strong><br />
<strong>Urban Homes Thames Coromandel</strong></p>
						
				        			</div>
				        											</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>
							</div>
